{
  "Name": "Belkin Wemo UPnP Remote Code Execution",
  "Description": "This module exploits a command injection in the Belkin Wemo UPnP API via the SmartDevURL argument to the SetSmartDevInfo action. This module has been tested on a Wemo-enabled Crock-Pot, but other Wemo devices are known to be affected, albeit on a different RPORT (49153).",
